<title>NETHERLANDS: HES BEHEER SAYS MARQUARD TALKS FAIL.</title>
<headline>HES BEHEER SAYS MARQUARD TALKS FAIL.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport and storage group HES Beheer said on Wednesday talks with Hamburg-based Marquard &amp; Bahls on the sale of HES' OBA dry bulk terminal had failed.</p>
<p>&quot;HES and Marquard...have not been able to reach an in principle agreement.&quot; HES said.</p>
<p>Both companies announced they had opened preliminary talks on May 10.</p>
<p>&quot;OBA contributed positively to HES' 1996 first half result,&quot; the Rotterdam-based company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
